invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_tcp.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: end calls ch_tcp_close where it calls ch_close, so the session
  dies with its keys wiped and sends no close_notify. The peer cannot tell
  a close from a cut connection (RFC 9846 section 6.1). loop_record.zig,
  which requires one alert record from end and the peer's read to report
  the close, objects.

--- old
            c.ch_close(self.tls());
--- new
            c.ch_tcp_close(&self.tcp);
